## Schema JSON-LD — Wajib untuk Semua SEO Landing Page Transfer
Setiap halaman cluster transfer (misal gilimanuk-to-ubud, gilimanuk-to-kuta, dst) WAJIB menggunakan satu `@graph` dengan hierarki berikut:

```
Organization
    ↓
TravelAgency
    ↓
Service
    ↓
FAQPage
    ↓
BreadcrumbList
    ↓
WebPage
```

Aturan relasi antar node:
- `TravelAgency` → `parentOrganization: { '@id': organizationId }`
- `Service` → `provider: { '@id': travelAgencyId }`
- `WebPage` → `about: { '@id': serviceId }`
- `WebPage` → `mainEntity: [{ '@id': serviceId }, { '@id': faqId }]`
- `WebPage` → `breadcrumb: { '@id': breadcrumbId }`
- `WebPage` → `publisher: { '@id': organizationId }`

Setiap node wajib punya `@id` unik menggunakan format:
```
const pageUrl = 'https://baliwesttransport.com/transfers/[rute]/';
const organizationId = `${pageUrl}#organization`;
const travelAgencyId = `${pageUrl}#travel-agency`;
const serviceId      = `${pageUrl}#service`;
const faqId          = `${pageUrl}#faq`;
const breadcrumbId   = `${pageUrl}#breadcrumb`;
const webPageId      = `${pageUrl}#webpage`;
```

Script ditulis sebagai satu tag:
```astro
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schemaGraph)} />
```

